2321	|	Brachyscome	|	0	|	0	|		|	The spelling 'Brachyscome' was used by Cassini in the protologue of 1815 but was subsequently changed by him to 'Brachycome', treating the original spelling as an orthographic error. Although subsequently 'Brachycome' was widely used, the original spelling 'Brachysome' has more recently become widely adopted in the Australian literature (see, e.g., Short 1988). Two attempts to conserve the spelling 'Brachycome' (Adolphi & Johnson 1989; Hind & Jeffrey 1988) have failed, on the grounds that it is not necessary to conserve an orthographic change made under Article 60.1 (Brummitt 1993). The Committee on Spermatophyta recommends that the original spelling 'Brachyscome' be retained (Brummitt 1993).	|	46665 46666 46667 46668 46669 46670 46671 46672 46673 46762 46763 59900 72905 119770 174448 199234 305701 315912 315913 315914 315915 315916 315917 315919 315920 315921 315922 315923 315924 315925 315926 315927 315928 315929 315930 	|
