5233	|	Agrobacterium tumefaciens =? Agrobacterium radiobacter = Rhizobium radiobacter	|	0	|	0	|		|	Young et al. (2001) reclassify Agrobacterium tumefaciens as Rhizobium radiobacter, essentially for the reasons outlined by Sawada et al. (1993). The proposal was strongly opposed by other members of the scientific community (Farrand et al., 2003). The Judicial Commission (JUDICIAL OPINION 94) (2014) notes that Agrobacterium radiobacter has nomenclatural priority over A. tumefaciens when treated as heterotypic synonyms, but that Agrobacterium tumefaciens retains the status of type species of the genus Agrobacterium.	|	358 362 	|
