9913	|	Flexibacter aurantiacus subspecies	|	0	|	0	|		|	The type strain of Flexibacter aurantiacus was transferred to Flavobacterium johnsoniae by Bernardet et al. (1996). Consequently, the rules of the Bacteriological Code require that the name Flexibacter aurantiacus be changed to Flavobacterium johnsoniae. However, the effectively published subspecies names \"Flexibacter aurantiacus subsp. copepodarum\" Lewin, and \"Flexibacter aurantiacus subsp. excathedrus\" Lewin were never validly published and continue to be used in various culture collections. On this basis, they are retained unchanged in the GenBank taxonomy database.	|	994 	|
