10768	|	Caulobacter vibrioides = Caulobacter crescentus	|	0	|	0	|		|	The type strain of C. crescentus (Stove CB2 = ATCC 15252 = DSM 4727 = VKM B-1493) shares 97% DNA homology with the type strain of C. vibrioides (Stove CB51 = CIP 106452 = DSM 9893 = VKM B-1496) (Moore et al. 1978). Abraham et al. (1999) have formally proposed that C. crescentus is a junior heterotypic synonym of C. vibrioides and, consequently, C. vibrioides is the scientifically correct name. However, C. crescentus is often used preferentially due to the greater volume of literature and sequence data generated for strains using this name rather than C. vibrioides.	|	155892 	|
