11674	|	Cutrobacterium plantarum = Pantoea agglomerans?	|	0	|	0	|		|	The American Type Culture Collection list the type strain of Curtobacterium plantarum (ATCC 49174) as belonging to Pantoea agglomerans.  The DSM culture collection notes for DSM 7069(T): 'according to fatty acid pattern and 16S rDNA sequence not a Curtobacterium, should be placed into the genus Pantoea.'	|	221276 	|
