19671	|	Genus Leukoma Romer 1857	|	0	|	0	|		|	The combination Protothaca staminea has been used in previous works, but the genus Leukoma (Leukoma Romer 1857) has priority over Protothaca, which is a junior synonym. For genus Leukoma see Treatise of Invertebrate Bivalvia volume 2 p. 688. Also see Mollusca collection catalogue of Santa Barbara Museum of Natural History http://www.sbcollections.org/iz/search_simple.php#sr\nMany (all?)  US West Coast bivalves previously classified in genus  Protothaca including 'staminea' have been transferred to genus Leukoma Romer, 1857.	|	462888 462889 	|
