25926	|	Rana sp. A	|	0	|	0	|		|	According to the \"Red Book of Threatened Amphibians and Reptiles of Bangladesh\" by IUCN, this frog was treated as Rana alticola (also named Clinotarsus alticola). But comparing with other Rana alticola we found this frog is quite different from those R. alticola. Now we are trying to clarify its taxonomy. [Masayuki Sumida, personal communication]	|	694508 	|
25927	|	Rana sp. B	|	0	|	0	|		|	According to the \"Red Book of Threatened Amphibians and Reptiles of Bangladesh\" by IUCN, this frog was treated as Rana taipehensis (also namedl Hylarana taipehensis). But comparing with other Rana taipehensis, we found this frog is quite different from those R. taipehensis. Now we are trying to clarify its taxonomy. [Masayuki Sumida, personal communication]	|	1659774 	|
25928	|	Microhyla sp. A	|	0	|	0	|		|	This frog (from Bangladesh) was found to be closer to Microhyla heymonsi (Malaysia) compared with other Microhylid frogs. We are trying to clarify its taxonomy. [Masayuki Sumida, personal communication]	|	694486 	|
