36658	|	Tubulifera arachnoidea is a synonym of Tubifera ferruginosa.	|	0	|	0	|		|	Lado C. (2011). The nomenclatural status of the genus Tubifera (Myxomycetes). TAXON 60 (1) February 2011: 221-222.\n\nTubifera J.F. Gmel. 1792 is a genus of Myxomycetes that has been used in floras and monographs since the 18th century. The name became controversial when it appeared that Tubulifera Jacq. 1779 was a priorable name for the genus. This paper presents a history of the controversy, interprets Jacquins original text, and offers reasons why Tubulifera cannot be regarded as a validly published generic name . The name Tubifera J.F. Gmel. is thus shown to remain the correct name for the genus.	|	435427 435428 	|
