45961	|	gencode:26:Pachysolen tannophilus Nuclear Code:260	|	0	|	0	|		|	{@GC26@}\n\n{head}Differences from the Standard Code:{head}\n{pre}\n          Code 26        Standard\n\nCUG       Ala            Leu\n\n{pre}\n\n{head}Initiation Codons:{head}\nAUG, GUG, UUG\n\n{head}Systematic Range:{head}\n\n{b}species in the genera Nakazawaea, Pachysolen and Peterozyma{b}\n\n{head}Comments:{head} Code 26 differs from the standard code only the translation of CUG as alanine (as opposed to leucine) ({link}{pubmed}27197221{pubmed}Muhlhausen et al. 2016{link}). It is also similar to code 12 that translates CUG as serine. Code 26 is used by the CUG-Ala clade that include a small number of yeast genera: Nakazawaea, Pachysolen and Peterozyma ({link}{pubmed}29760453{pubmed}Krassowski et al. 2018{link}).	|	1 	|
