92634	|	Paraoseomonas (sic) = Pararoseomonas	|	0	|	0	|		|	In the title of their manuscript, So et al. misspell the genus name 'Pararoseomonas' as 'Paraoseomonas'.  In the taxonomic descriptions, the novel spp. are (incorrectly?) described as 'Roseomonas alba', 'Roseomonas nitratireducens', 'Roseomonas indoligenes', and 'Roseomonas baculiformis'.  These names were subsequently published in Validaation List 223 of the IJSEM, thus making them the validly published names rather than the alternative names used by So et al.	|	2820810 2820811 2820812 2846776 	|
